"Father of the murdered family has been sentenced to death after constant cries of innocence.

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:41.760
"Upon further investigation it is concluded that young Amy Rinne...

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:44.680
"has stayed at her grandparents over the night of the massacre,

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.000
"and John Rinne remains missing from 5 years ago.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.240
"Grandparents say he ran away from his house at 16 years old."

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:52.580
whaaaaat?

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:54.740
What does that mean?

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.540
Who were--who's Amy and John?

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:58.460
What?

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:00.120
Who are these people?

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:01.460
Okay...

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:02.940
(You framed that man.)

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:03.940
What?!

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:05.220
(Made him die for you...)

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:06.460
Huh?!

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:08.240
(Purely unpleasant.)

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:11.340
Yeah, what a naughty person I is.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:17.220
"Mom finally brought me my own phone! My phone number is 419-948-7793."

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:21.020
Does that mean.. that's obviously the phone number that was on the note,

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:23.200
But why did it say, "Kill them all" above it?

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:29.900
"My brother was born in 1977 and my sister in 1993, those years I would never forgeT!"

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:34.300
Is there a reason why that T is capitalised? 1977 and 1993.

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:38.800
1977 and 1993! Remember that, 1977 and 1993!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:41.320
1977--77, 93!

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:42.540
77, 93!

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:43.880
7793!

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:45.820
OH. WAIT.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.120
*3 loud bangs*

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:49.640
I GET IT, YOU'RE TAKING A BOOPY!

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:51.680
BABOOPY, A BOOPY POOPY.

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:52.600
You're boopin'!

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:54.180
You're boopin' po--nevermind.

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:55.340
Going upstairs now.

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:57.500
1977, 1993.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.140
Well, 779--UUUUHHHH

00:12:59.140 --> 00:12:59.900
OKAYYYY.

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:01.840
FUCK YOU DUDE.

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:03.640
What the fuck, man?!

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:04.760
alright, so--

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:07.500
1977 and 1993. That's 77, 93--

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:08.720
*CRASH*

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:09.760
ARGHH fuck you...!

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:11.480
Where'd that fall from?

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:12.580
Nothing up there!

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:14.000
So 70's and 90's--

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:14.880
77, 93--

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:17.420
"I'm so sorry! I'll die tomorrow to be with you. Promise."

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:18.460
Okay,

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:20.840
Thanks, I was worried about that one.

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:23.200
You always come through with your promises for me.

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:25.680
Okay, so 77 and 93...

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:32.540
Oohh, well--OOH we're are going at it backwards this time!

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:33.560
Cool!

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:35.500
Me likey this!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:36.580
But why?

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:38.060
What is this doing---

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:42.900
ALRIGHT I'LL GO DOWN!

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:45.560
Why though?

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:51.900
okay!

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:53.420
fine. everything's fine then.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:58.600
Umm, "I had no idea it was them. I haven't seen them for 6 years! How could I forgot their faces so soon!

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:01.340
"The things I've done to them! How I killed them! It's impossible to live on."

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.840
WHAT DOES THAT MEAN?!

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:04.400
WHO AM I,

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.220
WHO MURDERED THESE PEOPLE- AM I THE FATHER?!

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:11.120
AND WHO ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT? "HAVEN'T SEEN THEM FOR 6 YEARS''?!

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:14.040
"I have no idea it was them"--what does that mean?

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.840
(You didn't realize that was your family you killed, didn't you?...)

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:17.880
I don't know.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:24.700
(Your mother...Your brother, and even your father. Luckily your little sister was spared....)

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:26.420
ooohh...

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:31.300
(In the end, you shot yourself...Hmm, how typical.)

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:32.180
okay...

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:35.040
I get it now.

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:36.620
Is anyone still in there?

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:38.120
okay.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:42.160
I gotta go, eventually so you gotta get out of there, but don't worry about it too much.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:44.140
Ooh, bright up here.

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:46.660
Okay, that makes more---- AHHH

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:48.980
aaaaaaalright.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.020
Okay, I'll go back down.

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:54.020
I guess it's finally my turn to go to the bathroom...

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:55.600
Anybody down here?

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:56.600
Anybody? Anybody?

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.540
OOH BOY.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:58.600
*Loud bang*
Oh!

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:01.740
okay...

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:04.340
Hi friend...

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:05.580
Ouh...

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:07.520
*Door creaking*

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:08.340
Oh okay.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:11.500
Wha--wha--no, don't leave me in here with him!

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:13.200
Not him! Okay...

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:14.240
What do I do?

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:15.400
Do I just...

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:17.740
OOOH

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:19.120
HEEYYY!

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:20.520
GOOD MORN--

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:21.260
OH.

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:22.480
OH BOY.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.560
OOH, OKAY.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:24.820
Woah!

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:25.560
Woah!!

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:27.000
That's so cool!

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:32.980
(Your mother, brother, and father. Dead by your own hands.)

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:35.040
Yeah, I get that now...
(And now you're here...)

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:38.200
(...On edge of both Heaven, and Hell.)

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:41.380
Uh-huh.
(Still trying to figure out where you belong.)

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:44.140
Okay??

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.280
But, you know...

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:49.060
I mean...
(You cut your mom up in front of your brother,)

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:50.860
(Then placed them both in the oven.)

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:55.160
(And watch them burn...burn!...BURN!)

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:56.040
Ahh...?

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:57.600
OKAY?

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:02.960
Yeah, I...it seems pretty cut and dry, not to make pun out of it, but--

00:16:03.220 --> 00:16:04.040
*BOOM*

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.000
Fuck off with you!

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:06.680
Hello...

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:07.880
Ah...

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:09.260
Lovely, that.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:10.760
Lovely.

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:12.340
okay...

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.420
So I get what I did now...

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:18.060
Feel free to continually punish me, I don't mind anymore.

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:19.960
This is a really cool game, by the way.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:21.760
I actually really like this, there's something about it---

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:27.040
(You then shoot yourself at your own work place, on the toilet...drunk.)

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.240
Mmhm...

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:31.580
I really admire this by the way, because you know,

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:34.120
obviously there's some things that seem hokey on the surface,

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:37.780
but that's just because, you know, this probably was made by one person or small team

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:43.180
(You see...the thing is...you knew from the start that was your family...didn't you?)

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:46.300
Well I didn't know anything. See, I wasn't there...

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:54.760
(Your hunger for money! Your over excessive greed took over you! Assuming with them all dead, you would be left a will...)

00:16:55.920 --> 00:17:01.340
(Wake up John! They all thought you were dead 6 years ago! So why in the hell would they leave you a will?)

00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:08.900
(Poor bastard ended up shooting himself when he finds out. You took everything from them to receive nothing.)

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:12.480
ahh, okay...

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:18.420
The motive there's a little convoluted--
(To this I ask you...which do you deserve?)

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:22.320
"Press 1 for Heaven, press 2 for Hell"?

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:23.000
WELL,

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:26.280
IF I HAD TO GO BASED ON WHAT THIS SEEMS TO BE,

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:30.080
I PRETTY MUCH DOUBT THAT I'M GONNA GO WITH OPTION NUMBER ONE...

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:34.060
So let's see what's behind... DOOOR NUMBER TWOOO!

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:39.340
(Hell? It's not everyday someone is willingly choosing their fate among Hell.)

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:41.020
I mean, just judging by the papers...

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:44.340
(I supposed you truly do believe that you've done wrong. Heh.)

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:49.100
(You surprise me, John, you truly are a unique individual.)

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:51.120
A murderous individual?!

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:59.940
(Truth be told, I can't simply let you off. Indeed, you will be going to Hell, no doubt, though, not for eternity.)

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.620
(You will spend a large portion of time,)
Oh jeez...

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:07.120
(constantly looping through your memories as you had already done.)

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:10.060
okay.

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:15.580
(Though, this time, your deeper emotions will be accessed and presented upon you.)

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:21.560
(Once you have gone through what you deserve, I will then judge once more)

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:24.540
(to decide whether an eternal stay at heaven...)

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:27.380
(Or hell will be best suited for you.)

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:34.080
(With that said...this is the last time I will be speaking to you for quite some time.)

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:37.100
(I wish you luck, John.)

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:42.020
*Melancholy piano music plays*

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:42.640
Is that the end-?

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:43.640
(Until we meet again.)

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.900
YEAH, THAT WAS GOOD!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.060
THAT WAS GOOD! THAT WAS REALLY GOOD!

00:18:57.060 --> 00:19:02.480
I mean, it was good because, obviously, it was made by one person. THAT WAS GOOD!

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:05.200
The story was convoluted, and it had a lot of plot holes,

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:08.600
and you know I couldn't tell it was trying to get me to feel sorry

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:12.800
for this guy, for being seemingly unapologetically murdered his whole family,

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:14.580
cut them up, and burn them alive.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:18.440
So I don't think I was supposed to be in any way agreeable to that outcome,

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:23.300
but I had fun! I mean, the looping mechanic is kind of like, you know, uh, I--

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.500
I lo--I love it, you know, I don't care how many times it's done.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:30.180
Not that has been done as many times as other horror tropes, but I love it.

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:33.220
Love it, love it, love it, I liked that, that was FUN,

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:37.480
GREAT STUFF. I appreciate it, this was cool.

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:41.420
I enjoyed it, it got me a couple times, it made me laugh a few other times,

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:45.460
because it was just a little hokey, but even so, so, I liked it.

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:48.760
So, I hope you liked it too, let me know what you thought in the comments below,

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:50.500
and check out the other scary games that I played

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:54.560
and you can check the link in the descrmmimn--in the description below. I can't talk but

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:59.420
Thank you everybody again, and as always I willl see YOU in the next video!

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:01.260
BUH-BYE!

